{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01FPkY9Jfigy58mzLsaQqHWj", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=132343\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thaipod101.com/blog/?p=4060\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.trueplookpanya.com/education/content/56298\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.trueplookpanya.com/education/content/56298-teamat--\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dltv.ac.th/utils/files/download/205775\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.trueplookpanya.com/blogdiary/26692\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.mcu.ac.th/directory_uploads/administrator/file_upload/20180808114856_FE8B8E3D-1296-4400-86F3-652E25795AAF.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dltv.ac.th/utils/files/download/179628\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.trueplookpanya.com/learning/detail/31175\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:24:08.857Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "สำนวนไทย ใฝ่ดีจะมีความสุขความเจริญ ใฝ่ชั่วจะได้รับความลำบาก", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01CtoH6M9one6QHEZJGdK6eb", "content": [{"title": "รักดีหามจั่ว รักชั่วหามเสา สำนวนไทยนี้มาจากไหน เกี่ยวอะไรกับ “จั่ว” และ “เสา”", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=132343"}, {"title": "The Top 30 Thai Proverbs and Sayings", "url": "https://www.thaipod101.com/blog/?p=4060"}, {"title": "43,940 Views", "url": "https://www.trueplookpanya.com/education/content/56298"}, {"title": "44,093 Views", "url": "https://www.trueplookpanya.com/education/content/56298-teamat--"}, {"title": "dltv.ac.th", "url": "https://dltv.ac.th/utils/files/download/205775"}, {"title": "www.trueplookpanya.com", "url": "https://www.trueplookpanya.com/blogdiary/26692"}, {"title": "20180808114856 FE8B8E3D 1296 4400 86F3 652E25795AAF", "url": "https://www.mcu.ac.th/directory_uploads/administrator/file_upload/20180808114856_FE8B8E3D-1296-4400-86F3-652E25795AAF.pdf"}, {"title": "dltv.ac.th", "url": "https://dltv.ac.th/utils/files/download/179628"}, {"title": "ภาษาไทย ม. 1 เรื่อง รวมสุภาษิต คำพังเพย และสำนวนไทย พร้อมความหมาย", "url": "https://www.trueplookpanya.com/learning/detail/31175"}]}, "The phrase you searched for is the meaning of the Thai proverb **\"รักดีหามจั่ว รักชั่วหามเสา\"** (roughly, loving goodness means being carried on a gable beam, loving wrongdoing means being carried on a pillar).\n\n- **Meaning:** A Silpa-Mag article says the Royal Institute Dictionary (2011 edition) defines the saying as the one you searched for: good-minded people prosper, and wrong-minded people suffer hardship. (Silpa-Mag article on the proverb's origin, citing the Royal Institute Dictionary's definition)\n- **Origin:** The same article links the saying's imagery to the wooden parts of a house, the gable beam and the pillar. It cites a scholar's essay in the Silpa Watthanatham magazine that explains the image in detail. I did not get the essay's full explanation in the results.\n- **Related sayings:** Thai saying collections also list proverbs about choosing good company, such as one contrasting a wicked companion with a wise one (ThaiPod101's list of Thai proverbs).\n\nSources: Silpa-Mag (silpa-mag.com/?p=132343) and ThaiPod101 (thaipod101.com/blog/?p=4060)."], "durationSeconds": 6.259474083, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01FPkY9Jfigy58mzLsaQqHWj", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEMKtmCs8CwPhofZ9YJ1", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:รักดีหามจั่ว รักชั่วหามเสา**\n\n意思是:一心向善的人会有幸福和兴旺,一心向恶的人会遭遇困苦。\n\n依据:Silpa-Mag 的文章引用了《ราชบัณฑิตยสถาน》(皇家学术院词典,2011 年版)对这句谚语的释义,与你给的意思一致。我只搜了一次。结果里没有拿到文章对“จั่ว”(屋脊梁)和“เสา”(柱子)这两个比喻来源的完整解释。\n\nSources:\n- [รักดีหามจั่ว รักชั่วหามเสา สำนวนไทยนี้มาจากไหน เกี่ยวอะไรกับ “จั่ว” และ “เสา” (Silpa-Mag)](https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=132343)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1215, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4342, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1215}, "output_tokens": 302, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:24:12.103Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEMKtX5WGm4q2kU8rWDm"}
